      "apiDescription": "## Models\n\nTwo-way bindings. Bind each one with the `v-model` syntax shown next to it — do not pass the prop and listen to its `update:` event separately.\n\n```\nexport type GCheckboxGroupModels = {\n  /**\n   * @description binding value\n   * @default []\n   */\n  modelValue?: CheckboxGroupValueType; // v-model=\"...\"\n}\n```\n\n## Props\n\n```\nexport type GCheckboxGroupProps = {\n  /** @description whether the nesting checkboxes are disabled */\n  disabled?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description whether to trigger form validation\n   * @default true\n   */\n  validateEvent?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description show the checkbox with bordered style\n   * @default false\n   */\n  border?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description show the checkbox with inverted order of label and check input\n   * @default false\n   */\n  invert?: boolean;\n  /**\n   * @description options for building checkboxes\n   * @default []\n   */\n  options?: Option[];\n  /**\n   * @description type of layout\n   * @default 'horizontal'\n   */\n  layout?: layoutType;\n  /**\n   * @description element tag of the checkbox group\n   * @default 'div'\n   */\n  tag?: string;\n  ariaLabel?: string;\n  /** @description minimum number of checkbox checked */\n  min?: number;\n  /** @description maximum number of checkbox checked */\n  max?: number;\n}\n```\n\n## Events\n\n```\nexport type GCheckboxGroupEvents = {\n  \"update:modelValue\": [val: CheckboxGroupValueType | CheckboxGroupValueType[]];\n  change: [val: CheckboxValueType[] | CheckboxGroupValueType[]];\n}\n```\n\n## Slots\n\nEach slot is typed with the props it passes to its content.\n\n```\nexport type GCheckboxGroupSlots = {\n  default: {};\n}\n```",
      "renderer": "vue3"
    }
